  "review": [
    "START-latched DS3231 secondary buffers make each contiguous00..06 read coherent. The extra seconds reread is explicitly only a conservative cross-phase freshness guard, with bounded retries and documented60second alias limitation.",
    "Gregorian validation agrees with datetime over2000..2199. Century mapping is an application epoch policy; documentation does not extend the chip automatic leap-year guarantee beyond its datasheet range.",
    "12h AM/PM masks, reserved-bit/BCD rejection, SET snapshot/seconds-first write and raw OSF/alarm status policies match the documented limited transaction scope. SET timing within1second remains a declared integration constraint, not a silent guarantee.",
    "Host command/result/done consumption is explicitly CE-qualified; physical shared-PHY progress is independent. NACK STOP and superseding physical errors are propagated. Shared PHY is referenced once through a package-relative dependency map."
  ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "status": "RESOLVED",
