      "description": "Initial review found transaction/error suites sharing label12h_13 and one standalone log being overwritten.",
      "resolution": "Owner archived previous evidence and prefixed error-suite labels. This final audit requires globally unique labels and exact nonempty-line correspondence for every persisted simulation log, plus all refreshed source/report/dependency bindings. RTL and shared PHY remain identical to independently pin-tested sources."
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Ideal digital pin models; no actual RTC, oscillator accuracy, electrical timing closure or combined-board fit validated.",
    "Read status is a separate transaction from time shadow; external writers and full60second aliasing are outside the conservative freshness check."
  ]
